{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Remembering Emily</strong> is a short visual novel in which Thomas, the protagonist, relives his memories of Emily\u2014memories that led him to her tragic end\u2026 although they might not be as clear as they first appear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fragmented Memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout the different chapters of <i>Remembering Emily</i>, Thomas will try to piece together what really happened. Each memory represents a possible path\u2026 and each path reveals a different truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player\u2019s choices are crucial in this story, as they lead to unique situations and two completely different\u2014but complementary\u2014endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698050/extras/elecciones.png?t=1750839384\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to uncover what truly happened with Emily, you\u2019ll need to reach both endings. Only then will you understand 100% of the story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While <i>Remembering Emily</i> features more characters than those shown here, this is a brief overview of the key figures in this tale of mystery and emotion:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698050/extras/emily_pj.png?t=1750839384\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Emily.</strong> She enters Thomas\u2019s life unexpectedly and quickly becomes someone essential to him\u2026 even after her tragic end, which ties her forever to his memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698050/extras/Noah.png?t=1750839384\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Noah.</strong> Throughout the story, Thomas recounts to Noah\u2014almost like a therapy session\u2014everything that happened with Emily. Noah plays a key role in helping him reconstruct his memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698050/extras/Kate.png?t=1750839384\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kate.</strong> Thomas\u2019s coworker and secretly in love with him. She\u2019s one of his closest friends and always by his side\u2026 even when Emily appears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698050/extras/Thomas.png?t=1750839384\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thomas.</strong> Through his eyes, we relive the past with Emily and discover why she left such a deep mark on his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join Thomas on a journey through his memories and uncover the truth behind this emotional, mysterious story.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698050?t=1750839384","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698050/d6a5704abdbd7608443366c4fef7413935e47646/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750839384","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698050/e895825f8c5431856b58f1a24927bd06965cfca8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750839384","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698050/e895825f8c5431856b58f1a24927bd06965cfca8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750839384","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"